  "body": {
    "id": "lem:local-risk-map",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "statement": "Uniformly on \\(\\mathcal U\\times\\mathcal D\\), \\(w_{P_{\\theta_n(u)}}(v_n(t))=w_0+n^{-1/2}h(u,t)+O(n^{-1})\\) and \\(\\sqrt n\\{R_{P_{\\theta_n(u)}}(v_n(t))-R_{P_{\\theta_0}}(v_0)\\}=\\Psi_{\\theta_0}(u,t)+o(1)\\). The map \\(\\Psi_{\\theta_0}\\) is continuous piecewise affine on finitely many polyhedral critical-cone cells and retains mean-completion, donor-mean, covariance-risk, and donor-weight derivatives.",
